!Name: p90forwlwss-1
!C A period 90 c/3 forward LWSS rake.
!C This uses a period 90 c/3 rake and two period 45 c/3 rakes to create
!C the forward LWSS stream which races ahead of the c/3 rake.  The LWSS
!C stream itself has a pseudo-period of 30.  This is an improvement on a
!C previous version of the rake.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
